      "judgment_rationale": "Web SkillDetail binds getEvolution to the skill evolution read contract in addition to revision-aware CRUD, content, package, export, version, and rollback flows. Desktop now has a real canonical loader, App binding, management state controller and native Skill manager in both modes. Web and Cloud tenant-scope writes require tenant administration, while project-scope writes use the project contributor branch; Local authority uses tenant roles without a separate project-role gate. The management observation used by Snapshot v4 has no authority revision, so both Desktop surfaces must remain capability_authority_revision_unavailable even though the native content and sidecar endpoints exist. ZIP import and Local evolution remain outside the current safe sidecar subset."
    }
